# Ad-hoc backup copies. This package has accumulated enough of these
# (*.bak_*, *.backup, *.disabled, and whole backup trees like
# web/js.bak_*/) that they were being loaded by import sweeps and served
# as web extensions alongside the live files. Commit a change, don't
# clone the file next to it.
*.bak
*.bak_*
*.backup
*.disabled

# Retired with the old node set. Left here so a personal copy that was never
